<%# The claim of a sweep read arm by arm against a control at the same cap: `reading` is a
    Findings::ComplexityArmsReading. The claim stands on the amended measured-run rule, so
    what the pre-registered rule read is stated with it (`docs/design_record.md`, 2026-09-21). %>
<div id="complexity-arms-verdict">
  <p>
    <span class="badge <%= reading.badge_class %>"><%= reading.verdict_label %></span>
    <strong><%= reading.headline %></strong>
  </p>
  <% reading.rising_notes.each do |note| %>
    <p><%= note %></p>
  <% end %>
  <p>
    That reading is taken under the measured-run rule as amended after the data were seen
    (<span class="mono">docs/design_record.md</span>, 2026-09-21).
    <strong><%= reading.pre_registered_sentence %></strong>
  </p>
</div>
